{"speciesId":270,"names":{"fr":"Nénupiot","es":"Lotad","en":"Lotad","ja":"ハスボー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LOTAD live in ponds and lakes, where they float on the surface. It grows weak if its broad leaf dies. On rare occasions, this POKéMON travels on land in search of clean water."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LOTAD is said to have dwelled on land before. However, this POKéMON is thought to have returned to water because the leaf on its head grew large and heavy. It now lives by floating atop the water."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"This POKéMON lives in ponds with clean water. It is known to ferry small POKéMON across ponds by carrying them on the broad leaf on its head."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It searches about for clean water. If it does not drink water for too long, the leaf on its head wilts."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It searches about for clean water. If it does not drink water for too long, the leaf on its head wilts."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its leaf grew too large for it to live on land. That is how it began to live floating in the water."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its leaf grew too large for it to live on land. That is how it began to live floating in the water."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il ressemble à une plante aquatique et fait la navette pour les Pokémon qui ne savent pas nager."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il ressemble à une plante aquatique et fait la navette pour les Pokémon qui ne savent pas nager."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il ressemble à une plante aquatique et fait la navette pour les Pokémon qui ne savent pas nager."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Parece una planta acuática. Hace de ferry para los Pokémon que no saben nadar."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"水草に そっくりな ポケモン。 泳げない ポケモンを 葉っぱに 乗せて 向こう岸まで 運ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Nénupiot recherche toujours les coins où coule de l’eau pure. S’il reste longtemps sans boire, la feuille sur sa tête commence à faner."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Va buscando agua potable para beber. Si no la encuentra pasado un tiempo, se le marchita la hoja de la cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It searches about for clean water. If it does not drink water for too long, the leaf on its head wilts."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"きれいな 水を 探して 歩く。 長い 時間 水を 飲まないと 頭の 葉っぱが 枯れてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nénupiot vit dans les étangs et les lacs, sur lesquels il flotte à la surface. Si sa feuille tombe, il est affaibli. De temps en temps, ce Pokémon sort sur la terre ferme à la recherche d’eau propre."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lotad vive en estanques y lagos, donde permanece flotando. Si se le marchita la ancha hoja que tiene en la cabeza, se debilitará. De vez en cuando, se desplaza en busca de agua limpia."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lotad live in ponds and lakes, where they float on the surface. It grows weak if its broad leaf dies. On rare occasions, this Pokémon travels on land in search of clean water."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"池や 湖の 水面に 浮いて 暮らす。 葉っぱが 枯れると 弱ってしまうが きれいな 水を 求めて たまに 陸地を 移動する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On raconte que jadis, Nénupiot vivait sur terre. Mais on pense que ce Pokémon est retourné dans l’eau car la feuille sur sa tête était devenue trop grande et trop lourde. Maintenant, il vit en flottant à la surface de l’eau."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A Lotad se le atribuye el haber vivido antes en tierra. En cualquier caso, se cree que volvió al agua porque la hoja de la cabeza le creció mucho y le empezó a pesar. Ahora vive flotando en el agua."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lotad is said to have dwelled on land before. However, this Pokémon is thought to have returned to water because the leaf on its head grew large and heavy. It now lives by floating atop the water."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"元々は 地上で 生活していたが 頭の 葉っぱが 重くなったので 水に 浮かんで 暮らすようになったと いわれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il recherche toujours les endroits où coule de l’eau pure. S’il reste longtemps sans boire, la feuille sur sa tête commence à faner."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Va buscando agua potable para beber. Si no la encuentra pasado bastante tiempo, la hoja de la cabeza se le marchita."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It searches about for clean water. If it does not drink water for too long, the leaf on its head wilts."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"きれいな 水を 探して 歩く。 長い 時間 水を 飲まないと 頭の 葉っぱが 枯れてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Sa feuille est devenue si grande et si lourde qu’il doit vivre en flottant sur l’eau."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"El excesivo tamaño y peso de la hoja que tiene en la cabeza ha propiciado que viva flotando en el agua."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Its leaf grew too large for it to live on land. That is how it began to live floating in the water."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"葉っぱが 大きく なりすぎて 重くなって しまったため 水に 浮かんで 暮らすように なった。"}],"varieties":[{"id":270,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[5,"level-up",3],[6,"level-up",3],[7,"level-up",3],[8,"level-up",3],[9,"level-up",3],[10,"level-up",3],[11,"level-up",3],[12,"level-up",3],[13,"level-up",3],[14,"level-up",3],[15,"level-up",3],[16,"level-up",3],[17,"level-up",3],[18,"level-up",3],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mist","learns":[[5,"level-up",21],[6,"level-up",21],[7,"level-up",21],[8,"level-up",11],[9,"level-up",11],[10,"level-up",11],[11,"level-up",11],[12,"level-up",21],[13,"level-up",21],[14,"level-up",11],[15,"level-up",11],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[20,"level-up",9],[23,"level-up",9],[25,"level-up",9]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"level-up",6],[23,"level-up",6],[23,"egg",0],[25,"level-up",6]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine"